\ pow_vectors.fam — tabminer's values for pow.fam (docs/NODE.md, step 4).
\ Written by miner/src/fam_vectors.rs (`cargo test --lib write_fam_vectors
\ -- --ignored`); not to be edited.  Plain code, for pow_test.fam (a
\ program under the OS, after powinit): it counts the checks in vpass
\ and vfail.

: vx variable ;  : vy variable ;  : vz variable ;  : vw variable ;  : vpass variable ;  : vfail variable ;
: vinit  vx @ 0= if 100 lit alloc vx !  100 lit alloc vy !  100 lit alloc vz !  100 lit alloc vw ! then ;
: v!  begin dup while 1 lit - rot 2 lit pick 2 lit pick w! repeat 2drop ;
: wfrom  0 lit do dup i w@ fromm over i w! loop drop ;
: vok  if vpass @ 1 lit + vpass ! else vfail @ 1 lit + vfail !  "pow_vectors: check " puts vpass @ vfail @ + u. " failed" puts 0A lit putc then ;
\ vsame ( n -- )  vz holds the n words vw does.
: vsame  vz @ vw @ rot wcmp 0= vok ;
: vexp  vw @ swap v! ;

